  },
  "inviteTreeQaFriendsA": "Some of them do. The first pair of each person in your slots adds data for that person, and a smaller amount for you. Their other pairs add data only for them. Further away, only first pairs add data for you, and the further away they are, the less they add, until they add nothing.",
